# HEIMDALL repository hygiene
#
# Source code, governed configuration, documentation, immutable sample artifacts,
# and test fixtures are intentionally versioned. This file excludes only
# developer-local state, build outputs, credentials, and reproducible outputs.

### Operating system / file manager ###
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon?
._*
.Spotlight-V100/
.Trashes/
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

### Editors and IDEs ###
.idea/
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
*.code-workspace
*.sublime-workspace
*.sublime-project
*.swp
*.swo
*~
\#*\#
.#*

